    "## 5. Building agents\n",
    "\n",
    "**Workings:** `Building` carries size (lognormal), age (uniform 0\u201380), location quality (Beta), neighbourhood, derived retrofit time `base_time \u00d7 size \u00d7 (1+age/100)` and cost `week_cost \u00d7 time \u00d7 size`, condition \u2208 [0.2,1], and state machine `to_do \u2192 queued \u2192 in_progress \u2192 finished`.\n",
    "\n",
    "`create_buildings` assigns neighbourhoods to match household neighbourhoods (spatial structure). `create_new_building` makes modern small buildings for construction. `depreciate_buildings` ages condition weekly (retrofitted buildings degrade at half rate) and updates `depreciated_value = retrofit_cost \u00d7 condition`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
