    "## 6. Bank agents\n",
    "\n",
    "**Workings:** Heterogeneous lenders with LTV cap (clipped 0.5\u20130.95) and rate spread. `offer_terms` prices loans: `rate = 3% + spread + risk_premium`, where risk premium rises with LTV and falls with the co-op's wealth cushion. `check_defaults` triggers when `coop.account < -0.1 \u00d7 loan_remaining`; `process_default` recovers 50% of principal and writes off the rest. `adjust_terms` tightens LTV/spread after losses and loosens after price growth (not called in the main loop, but available for adaptation experiments).\n"
   ]
  },
