    "## 11. Run the simulation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Workings:** Build a `Params` instance (here a feature-rich configuration exercising bargaining, banking, defaults, income process, investors, construction, demographics, neighbourhoods and heterogeneous expectations), call `run_simulation`, then print headline monitors. Adjust parameters here to experiment.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Behaviour:** With `run_time=520` this is a ~10-year run. Larger `n`/`run_time` increase runtime roughly linearly.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
