    "**Workings:** Every weekly time series in `result` is plotted against `weeks = np.arange(total_weeks)`. Scalar finals are printed above. Multi-neighbourhood and sample-trajectory arrays are handled specially. Missing/None arrays are skipped gracefully.\n"
